#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:9
msgid "OS 源码可移植性：目标设计"
msgstr "OS source portability: target design"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:11
msgid ""
"本页帮助维护者审查统一 OS 接口、静态内存和后端扩展之间的边界。它是以 `main@86f94e69` "
"为现状依据的目标提案，尚未改变公共头、配置合同或后端实现。 实施顺序、任务和退出条件见[实施计划](../development/os-"
"portability-plan.md)。 当前行为仍由 [OS "
"执行合同](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md)和 "
"[后端接入合同](../reference/contracts/os/backend-integration.md)维护。"
msgstr ""
"This page helps maintainers review the boundaries between a common OS "
"interface, static memory and backend extensions. It is a target proposal "
"based on the current implementation at `main@86f94e69`; it has not changed "
"public headers, configuration contracts or backend implementations. See the "
"[implementation plan](../development/os-portability-plan.md) for sequencing,"
" tasks and exit criteria. Current behavior remains governed by the [OS "
"execution contract](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md) and the [backend"
" integration contract](../reference/contracts/os/backend-integration.md)."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:17
msgid ""
"目标是：常规业务与可复用执行组件更换 OS 时保持源码不变，装配侧调整后端选择、 资源预算和明确使用的专有扩展。源码可移植不表示二进制 "
"ABI、调度时序、最小栈或 所有内核特性相同；Host 执行也不建立 MCU 实时性或物理验证资格。"
msgstr ""
"The goal is to keep ordinary business logic and reusable execution "
"components unchanged when switching OS backends. Assembly code adjusts "
"backend selection, resource budgets and explicitly selected backend-specific"
" extensions. Source portability does not imply identical binary ABIs, "
"scheduling behavior, minimum stacks or all kernel features. Host execution "
"establishes neither MCU real-time behavior nor physical qualification."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:21
msgid "当前限制与目标"
msgstr "Current limitations and targets"

