msgid "专有能力"
msgstr "Backend-specific capabilities"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "原生类型和扩展入口"
msgstr "Native types and extension entry points"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "仅专有集成使用明确扩展，普通业务不依赖它们"
msgstr ""
"Only backend-specific integration uses explicit extensions; ordinary "
"business logic does not depend on them"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "裸机"
msgstr "Baremetal"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "非阻塞通知，没有任务调度器"
msgstr "Nonblocking notification, without a task scheduler"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "保留机制；要求 task-profile 的配置直接拒绝"
msgstr ""
"Retain the mechanism; reject configurations that require a task-profile"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:32
msgid ""
"当前后端专用 API 已暴露真实成本，但把任务和队列的内核身份带入了应用。 资源透明并不要求业务使用内核类型。统一源码接口也不需要固定最大对象、动态 "
"句柄表或每次调用检查后端；应分别解决接口合同、存储布局和编译选择。"
msgstr ""
"The current backend-specific APIs expose actual costs, but bring kernel-"
"specific task and queue identities into applications. Resource transparency "
"does not require business logic to use kernel types. A common source "
"interface also does not require fixed maximum objects, dynamic handle tables"
" or checking the backend on every call. Interface contracts, storage layouts"
" and compile-time selection should be addressed separately."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:36
msgid "依赖、职责与目录"
msgstr "Dependencies, responsibilities and directories"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:38
msgid ""
"![FIG-27：目标 OS 构建依赖，单镜像只选择一个后端](../assets/diagrams/os-portability-"
"target.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-27: target OS build dependencies, with one selected backend per "
"image](../assets/diagrams/os-portability-target.svg)"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:38
msgid "FIG-27：目标 OS 构建依赖，单镜像只选择一个后端"
msgstr ""
"FIG-27: target OS build dependencies, with one selected backend per image"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:40
msgid ""
"FIG-27 的身份是 target，每条箭头都表示构建期依赖，包含编译依赖和链接时的实现 "
"选择，不表示启动顺序、每次运行调用或所有权转移。图中的后端是互斥选择； 应用不会同时链接三个同名 OS 实现。 图只覆盖 task-"
"profile，不包含裸机路径。目标结构不让普通 I/O 强制经过 OS， 也不新增运行期 factory、worker 或对象池。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-27 is a target diagram. Every arrow denotes a build-time dependency, "
"including compilation dependencies and implementation selection at link "
"time; it does not denote startup order, every runtime call or ownership "
"transfer. The backends shown are mutually exclusive choices: an application "
"does not link three OS implementations with the same symbols. The diagram "
"covers only the task-profile, not the Baremetal path. Ordinary I/O is not "
"forced through the OS, and the target adds no runtime factory, worker or "
"object pool."

