#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:55
msgid ""
"该划分对应 SOLID：接口与存储各有单一变化原因；新增后端实现同一合同；只有满足 "
"合同的能力才能替换；小接口分离基础与可选能力；组件依赖公共端口。它不要求为 每个函数增加接口层，也不允许以 `UNSUPPORTED` "
"掩盖已声明能力的缺失。"
msgstr ""
"This division follows SOLID: interfaces and storage each have a single "
"reason to change; new backends implement the same contract; only "
"capabilities that satisfy the contract are substitutable; small interfaces "
"separate basic and optional capabilities; and components depend on public "
"ports. It does not require another interface layer for every function, or "
"permit `UNSUPPORTED` to hide missing capabilities that a backend has "
"declared."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:59
msgid "拟议目录如下；这些路径不表示文件已存在。按真实规模分文件，不创建空目录。"
msgstr ""
"The proposed directories are shown below; these paths do not mean the files "
"already exist. Split files according to actual scale, without creating empty"
" directories."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:77
msgid ""
"后端内部可以按 task、notify、queue 等实际职责拆分 C 单元，共享少量私有辅助。 不为了目录对称引入 forwarding 文件。现有 "
"MPU、Secure、端口准备工具与锁定 依赖继续归后端维护；Host 准备脚本不进入固件，不修改 vendor 原件。"
msgstr ""
"Backend C translation units may be split by actual responsibilities such as "
"task, notify and queue, sharing a small set of private helpers. Do not add "
"forwarding files merely for directory symmetry. Existing MPU, Secure, port "
"preparation tools and locked dependencies remain with their backend. Host "
"preparation scripts do not enter firmware or modify vendor originals."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:81
msgid "编译期选择与静态存储"
msgstr "Compile-time selection and static storage"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:83
msgid ""
"拟议通用函数在各后端具有相同符号，CMake 每次只选择一个实现。无需 `switch(os_type)`、通用 ops "
"表、运行期名称查找或动态对象池。保留 `nx_wait_port_t` 的 callback，是因为组件需要连接具体通知对象，与整幅镜像 "
"选择内核是不同问题；不再包一层通知 vtable。"
msgstr ""
"The proposed common functions use the same symbols in every backend, with "
"CMake selecting just one implementation. No `switch(os_type)`, common ops "
"table, runtime name lookup or dynamic object pool is needed. The callbacks "
"in `nx_wait_port_t` remain because components must connect to specific "
"notification objects, which is distinct from selecting the kernel for an "
"entire image. No further notification vtable is added."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:88
msgid ""
"业务头只看到未完成类型及引用。装配文件包含选定布局头，才能定义实际存储； 同一对象直接形成业务引用，不额外分配一个只保存指针的包装对象。 "
"原生控制块头可以成为装配文件的编译依赖，但不进入业务头。"
msgstr ""
"Business headers see only incomplete types and references. Assembly files "
"include the selected layout header to define actual storage. The same object"
" directly supplies the business reference, without another allocated wrapper"
" that holds only a pointer. Native control-block headers may be compilation "
"dependencies of assembly files, but do not enter business headers."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:92
msgid "以下仅为拟议写法示意，尚无可运行教程或稳定 API；省略了初始化与失败处理："
msgstr ""
"The following illustrates only proposed syntax, not a runnable tutorial or "
"stable API. Initialization and failure handling are omitted:"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:101
msgid ""
"栈容量对外以 B 表示。后端检查对齐、启动帧、容量溢出和原生单位换算；TCB、 任务上下文、同步对象和队列数据区由外部 owner "
"持有。布局由真实选定类型决定， 不维护另一套手写 sizeof，不预留跨内核最大 union，不把固定字节数组当通用 TCB。 "
"选择不同内核或配置后必须重新编译，并重新核对 `sizeof`、alignment 和预算。"
msgstr ""
"Stack capacity is expressed externally in B. Backends check alignment, "
"startup frames, capacity overflow and conversion to native units. The "
"external owner holds TCBs, task contexts, synchronization objects and queue "
"data areas. Layouts follow the actual selected types: there is no second "
"handwritten sizeof authority, no cross-kernel maximum union, and no fixed "
"byte array used as a universal TCB. Changing the kernel or configuration "
"requires recompilation and a fresh check of `sizeof`, alignment and budgets."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:106
msgid ""
"配置沿用现有 TOML、typed IR 和 CMake 单一路径。能力要求在同一解析链校验， 不新增 Kconfig、缓存回退或第二套生成权威。新 "
"MCU 若复用已有 CPU/内核合同， 应提供 SoC、IRQ、时钟和 Board 事实；只有新端口或新语义才修改 OS 集成。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration follows the existing single TOML, typed IR and CMake path. "
"Capability requirements are validated in the same resolution chain, without "
"adding Kconfig, cache fallbacks or a second generation authority. A new MCU "
"that reuses an existing CPU/kernel contract should provide SoC, IRQ, clock "
"and Board facts. OS integration changes only for a new port or new "
"semantics."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:110
msgid "通用能力与可选扩展"
msgstr "Common capabilities and optional extensions"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:112
msgid ""
"task-profile 指要求真实任务调度的目标能力集合，不是已存在的配置键。 它覆盖 FreeRTOS、ThreadX 和满足所选合同的 "
"Native；裸机只保留非阻塞机制。 同步对象和关闭能力按需选择，不让全部对象承担最高成本。"
msgstr ""
"A task-profile is the target set of capabilities requiring actual task "
"scheduling; it is not an existing configuration key. It covers FreeRTOS, "
"ThreadX and Native implementations satisfying the selected contract. "
"Baremetal retains only nonblocking mechanisms. Synchronization objects and "
"close support are selected as needed, rather than making every object bear "
"the highest cost."

