msgstr ""
"Close send admission, broadcast shutdown and retain existing data for "
"draining"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "额外 waiter 存储与广播成本"
msgstr "Additional waiter storage and broadcast cost"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "Mutex"
msgstr "Mutex"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "task owner、解锁归属、明确优先级继承与递归政策"
msgstr ""
"Task ownership, unlock ownership, and explicit priority-inheritance and "
"recursion policy"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "后端必须真实实现所选政策"
msgstr "The backend must actually implement the selected policy"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "Semaphore"
msgstr "Semaphore"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "计数上限、获取/发布、明确饱和与 IRQ 范围"
msgstr ""
"Count limit, acquire/release, and explicit saturation behavior and IRQ scope"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "不冒充有 owner 的 mutex"
msgstr "Does not impersonate an owned mutex"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:127
msgid ""
"FreeRTOS 直接通知槽、ThreadX 抢占阈值、MPU 受限任务和 Secure 上下文属于显式 "
"扩展。应用选择这些能力就接受对应装配的移植成本；不能让普通组件私自依赖它们。 不默认引入软件 timer daemon、事件派发线程或通用 user-"
"object pool。"
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS direct-notification slots, ThreadX preemption thresholds, MPU "
"restricted tasks and Secure contexts are explicit extensions. Applications "
"selecting them accept the corresponding assembly migration cost; ordinary "
"components must not introduce undeclared dependencies on them. No software "
"timer daemon, event dispatch thread or general user-object pool is "
"introduced by default."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:131
msgid "任务、启动与回收"
msgstr "Tasks, startup and reclamation"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:133
msgid ""
"拟议任务接口统一入口签名、可返回/永久分类和结果语义。start 成功后任务可能已经 执行，甚至在 start 返回前结束；context "
"和必要连接必须先准备完成。 创建被拒绝时不保留 entry/context。若底层部分资源未能撤回，必须返回明确的残余 "
"责任并保留控制对象，不能把它描述成可立即重用的干净拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"The proposed task interface unifies entry signatures, returnable/permanent "
"categories and result semantics. A task may already be executing after start"
" succeeds, or may even finish before start returns; its context and required"
" connections must be prepared first. Rejected creation retains no "
"entry/context references. If some underlying resources cannot be withdrawn, "
"the result must identify residual responsibility and retain the control "
"object; it must not describe this as a clean rejection permitting immediate "
"reuse."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:138
msgid ""
"可返回任务的入口返回只表示业务结束。FreeRTOS 外部删除、ThreadX 的真实删除、 pthread join "
"由后端实现；共同成功条件是内核与适配层已解除对应引用。 join 超时不强杀任务，不释放栈、TCB 或 context；self-join 和竞争 "
"join 被拒绝。 不提供一个声称能安全撤销所有业务效果的通用 task-kill。"
msgstr ""
"A returnable task entry returning means only that its business work has "
"ended. The backend implements external FreeRTOS deletion, actual ThreadX "
"deletion or pthread join. Success requires the kernel and adapter to have "
"detached the corresponding references. A join timeout neither kills the task"
" nor frees its stack, TCB or context. Self-join and competing joins are "
"rejected. There is no generic task-kill claiming to safely undo all business"
" effects."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:143
msgid ""
"公共启动入口应统一外部流程，并让调用者提供明确 bootstrap 回调；不得伪装内核 已经处于同一状态。FreeRTOS "
"的调度器前创建、ThreadX 的真实 `tx_application_define` 引导范围，以及 Native 已运行进程内的线程创建不同。 "
"首批任务在允许的阶段创建；bootstrap 只完成声明允许的非阻塞操作。 平台启动仍不启动调度器，不允许将已运行内核重新解释成冷态 "
"bootstrap。"
msgstr ""
"The common startup entry should unify the external flow and take an explicit"
" caller-provided bootstrap callback; it must not pretend that all kernels "
"are already in the same state. FreeRTOS pre-scheduler creation, the actual "
"ThreadX `tx_application_define` bootstrap scope, and Native thread creation "
"inside an already running process differ. Initial tasks are created in the "
"permitted phase, and bootstrap performs only declared nonblocking "
"operations. Platform startup still does not start the scheduler, and a "
"running kernel must not be reinterpreted as a cold bootstrap."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:149
msgid ""
"Native 当前有限 join 是实际缺口：`pthread_join` 没有 deadline，入口完成提示也 不证明 pthread "
"已退出。目标必须接入并验证真实单调截止时间 join 能力；不满足的 Host 组合拒绝所需 profile。受支持平台可用真实 try-join "
"配合同一单调 deadline 和有界等待；禁止完成标志后无界 join、反复重置预算或忽略期限的轮询。"
msgstr ""
"Bounded Native join is a current implementation gap: `pthread_join` has no "
"deadline, and an entry-completion hint does not prove that the pthread has "
"exited. The target must integrate and verify actual monotonic-deadline join "
"support, rejecting Host combinations that cannot satisfy the required "
"profile. Supported platforms may use actual try-join with the same monotonic"
" deadline and bounded waits. An unbounded join after a completion flag, "
"repeatedly resetting the budget, or polling that ignores expiry is "
"prohibited."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:154
msgid "队列、通道和同步语义"
msgstr "Queue, channel and synchronization semantics"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:156
msgid ""
"基础队列不承担关闭广播。发送成功表示队列已复制 item，接收成功才交付 item； 超时或关闭拒绝不能偷偷消费 item，也不能在失败时改写接收输出。"
" 排队指针只复制指针，payload 的借用与回收仍由调用者协议负责。"
msgstr ""
"Basic queues do not bear close-broadcast costs. A successful send means the "
"queue has copied the item; only a successful receive delivers an item. A "
"timeout or close rejection must not silently consume an item or modify "
"receive output on failure. Queueing a pointer copies only that pointer; the "
"caller protocol still owns payload borrowing and reclamation."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:160
msgid ""
"可关闭通道复用现有正确性要求：close 后拒绝新发送，唤醒已登记阻塞者，旧 item 仍可接收，排空后接收返回关闭结果。控制对象、每个并发 "
"waiter 和数据区都由 调用者提供；destroy 要求 closed、drained 且 users/publishers 已退出。 close "
"和 destroy 不替代执行 owner 推进；不能以定期超时检查代替关闭唤醒。"
msgstr ""
"Closable channels retain existing correctness requirements: after close, new"
" sends are rejected, registered blockers are woken, existing items remain "
"receivable, and receive reports closure once drained. Callers provide the "
"control object, every concurrent waiter and the data area. Destroy requires "
"closed, drained state and exited users/publishers. Close and destroy do not "
"replace execution-owner progress, and periodic timeout checks must not "
"substitute for close wakeups."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:165
msgid ""
"Mutex 固定 owner 与非法解锁行为，递归作为显式选择。优先级继承不得用普通 binary semaphore 代替。Semaphore "
"明确最大计数与满时结果；所有对象都需要先 退出等待者和发布者，再销毁。销毁失败保留尚未解除的资源，只允许受审的重试。"
msgstr ""
"Mutexes define ownership and invalid-unlock behavior, with recursion "
"selected explicitly. An ordinary binary semaphore must not substitute for "
"priority inheritance. Semaphores define the maximum count and the result "
"when full. All objects require waiters and publishers to exit before "
"destruction. Destruction failures retain resources not yet released, "
"permitting only reviewed retries."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:169
msgid "时间、优先级与上下文"
msgstr "Time, priorities and context"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:171
msgid ""
"有限等待保持现有绝对单调微秒合同；后端向上换算 tick，跨唤醒重算剩余预算。 无限等待只能显式选择 "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`；溢出不能降为无限。立即可满足的 操作可先成功，等待错误后仍按公共 Wait 合同重查真实条件。 "
"时间域必须在等待、排空和 join 期间连续；重启 epoch 后旧 deadline 失效。"
msgstr ""
"Bounded waits retain the existing absolute monotonic-microsecond contract. "
"Backends round tick conversions upward and recompute the remaining budget "
"across wakeups. Infinite waits require explicit `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`; "
"overflow must not turn into infinity. An immediately satisfiable operation "
"may succeed first, and the authoritative predicate is still rechecked after "
"wait errors under the public Wait contract. The time domain must remain "
"continuous through waiting, draining and join; restarting the epoch "
"invalidates old deadlines."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:176
msgid ""
"目标还提供 task-only 的 `sleep_until` 和 `yield`，避免周期业务调用原生 delay。 `sleep_until` "
"使用同域绝对 deadline，已过期立即返回，不推进设备，也不保证微秒 唤醒精度。`yield` "
"只是调度提示，不保证公平、指定下一任务或让低优先级任务运行。 两者不隐建 timer worker，可归入 `task.h`，不为两个函数机械增加模块。"
msgstr ""
"The target also provides task-only `sleep_until` and `yield` so periodic "
"business logic need not call native delay APIs. `sleep_until` uses an "
"absolute deadline in the same domain, returns immediately if expired, does "
"not service devices and does not guarantee microsecond wake precision. "
"`yield` is only a scheduling hint: it guarantees neither fairness, a "
"specific next task nor execution of a lower-priority task. Neither "
"implicitly creates a timer worker. They may belong in `task.h`, without "
"mechanically adding a module for two functions."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:181
msgid ""
"逻辑优先级拟议为数值越大优先级越高，具体值放装配，后端映射原生编号。 可用等级、保留等级、时间片与调度政策必须在配置中校验。Native 当前没有任务 "
"优先级接口；普通 pthread 调度不能证明 MCU 抢占等价。若组件要求真实优先级 排序，Host "
"必须实现并验证对应调度能力，否则拒绝该能力要求，不忽略参数。"
msgstr ""
"The proposed logical priority increases with its numeric value. Values "
"belong in assembly, and backends map native numbering. Available levels, "
"reserved levels, time slicing and scheduling policy must be validated in "
"configuration. Native currently has no task-priority interface, and ordinary"
" pthread scheduling cannot prove equivalent MCU preemption. If a component "
"requires actual priority ordering, Host must implement and verify that "
"scheduling capability or reject the requirement, rather than ignore the "
"parameter."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "上下文"
msgstr "Context"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "目标准入"
msgstr "Target admission"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "普通 task"
msgstr "Ordinary task"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "已运行的正确内核、受支持权限和屏蔽状态；阻塞只在允许阶段"
msgstr ""
"Correct running kernel, supported privilege and mask state; blocking only in"
" permitted phases"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "Bootstrap"
msgstr "Bootstrap"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "只允许该内核真实阶段支持的创建与非阻塞连接，不允许等待未来任务"
msgstr ""
"Only creation and nonblocking connection supported in the actual kernel "
"phase; no waiting for future tasks"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "IRQ 发布"
msgstr "IRQ publication"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "独立入口，先核验 IRQ 范围、mask、分组与 syscall ceiling"
msgstr ""
"Separate entry; first validate IRQ range, masks, grouping and syscall "
"ceiling"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "NMI / fault / 其他安全域"
msgstr "NMI / fault / other security domains"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "不继承普通 IRQ 合同，未维护的组合拒绝"
msgstr ""
"Does not inherit the ordinary IRQ contract; reject unmaintained combinations"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "MPU 用户任务"
msgstr "MPU user task"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "仅受审 syscall；公共名称不自动授予原生内核或 I/O 权限"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed syscalls only; public names do not automatically grant native-"
"kernel or I/O privileges"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:194
msgid ""
"现有后端没有的 ISR 队列不能靠重命名变为支持。Mutex 与阻塞操作不在 ISR 调用。 实际 IRQ 原语继续保存/恢复 incoming "
"mask，不用本地关中断声称获得 SMP、DMA 或跨安全域互斥。Secure companion 不增加第二个 "
"scheduler，信任边界保持原合同。"
msgstr ""
"Renaming cannot establish ISR queue support absent from current backends. "
"Mutex and blocking operations are not called from ISRs. Actual IRQ "
"primitives continue to save/restore incoming masks. Disabling local "
"interrupts does not establish SMP, DMA or cross-security-domain exclusion. "
"The Secure companion adds no second scheduler, and the trust boundary "
"remains governed by the original contract."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:198
msgid "结果、停止与失败责任"
msgstr "Results, stopping and failure responsibility"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:200
msgid ""
"目标错误归类沿用 Core 结果类型，不建立另一套 OS 错误枚举；各 API 冻结时细化 "
"准确码值与输出规则。参数、能力与上下文错误必须在对象和内核效果变更前拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Target error classification retains Core result types rather than adding "
"another OS error enumeration. Exact codes and output rules are refined when "
"each API is frozen. Argument, capability and context errors must be rejected"
" before object changes or kernel effects."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "结果类别"
msgstr "Result category"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "存储和后续责任"
msgstr "Storage and subsequent responsibility"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "参数/上下文拒绝"
msgstr "Argument/context rejection"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "不取得新的业务借用，不执行内核操作"
msgstr "No new business loans or kernel operations"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "必需能力不满足"
msgstr "Required capability not satisfied"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "配置失败；动态扩展另按明确接口拒绝，不偷偷选择替代模式"
msgstr ""
"Configuration fails; dynamic extensions reject under their explicit "
"interfaces, without silently selecting a replacement mode"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "等待超时"
msgstr "Wait timeout"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "结束本次等待；保留任务、请求和其他未结束借用"
msgstr "End this wait; retain tasks, requests and other outstanding loans"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "通道关闭"
msgstr "Channel closure"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "停止发送准入；继续 drain 和等待者退出"
msgstr "Stop send admission; continue draining and waiter exit"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "忙/尚未退出"
msgstr "Busy/not yet exited"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "保留同一存储，继续必要进度，不能重新 init"
msgstr ""
"Retain the same storage and continue necessary progress; no reinitialization"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "部分清理失败"
msgstr "Partial cleanup failure"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:0
msgid "保留精确残余资源和恢复责任，不伪报 destroy 成功"
msgstr ""
"Retain exact residual resources and recovery responsibility; do not falsely "
"report successful destroy"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:212
msgid ""
"![FIG-08：当前等待、真实条件重查与外部退出责任](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-08: current waiting, authoritative predicate recheck and external "
"shutdown responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:212
msgid "FIG-08：当前等待、真实条件重查与外部退出责任"
msgstr ""
"FIG-08: current waiting, authoritative predicate recheck and external "
"shutdown responsibilities"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:214
msgid ""
"FIG-08 是当前合同图，目标继续保留其中的等待协议与退出责任。请求 SETTLED、 任务入口完成、join "
"成功、通知发布者退出分别证明不同事实。应用先关准入，继续 执行 owner 的取消/排空，再会合有关任务和 IRQ 发布路径。通知和队列只在全部 "
"相关发布者与等待者会合后销毁。平台时钟与 Tick 保留到全部消费者静默且所选内核 生命周期允许撤回；不能在内核运行时直接撤销，也不承诺当前支持 "
"scheduler shutdown。失败时保留尚未结清的引用，不把 timeout/cancel 当作存储释放。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-08 shows the current contract, whose waiting protocol and shutdown "
"responsibilities remain in the target. Request SETTLED, task-entry "
"completion, successful join and notification-publisher exit each prove "
"distinct facts. Applications first close admission, keep the execution owner"
" progressing cancellation/drain, and then join the relevant tasks and IRQ "
"publication paths. Notifications and queues are destroyed only after all "
"relevant publishers and waiters have quiesced and been joined. Platform "
"clocks and Tick remain until every consumer is quiescent and the selected "
"kernel lifecycle permits withdrawal. They must not simply be withdrawn while"
" the kernel is running, and current scheduler shutdown support is not "
"promised. Failures retain outstanding references; timeout/cancel does not "
"release storage."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:221
msgid "成本、参考与验收边界"
msgstr "Costs, references and acceptance boundaries"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:223
msgid ""
"编译期共同符号避免额外后端分派，但统一合同仍可能需要完成状态、deadline 换算或上下文检查。精简对象按能力选用；未选择的 "
"channel、mutex、trace、MPU 与 Secure 状态不得进入普通对象。报告分别列对象、栈、payload、内核全局状态、 Flash "
"和总保留 RAM，不用单个 `sizeof` 代表整幅镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Common compile-time symbols avoid additional backend dispatch, but the "
"unified contract may still require completion state, deadline conversion or "
"context checks. Select lean objects by capability. Unselected channel, "
"mutex, trace, MPU and Secure state must not enter ordinary objects. Reports "
"separately list objects, stacks, payloads, kernel-global state, Flash and "
"total retained RAM; a single `sizeof` does not represent the entire image."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:228
msgid ""
"现有 [Wait 成本夹具](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_wait_cost/README.md)与 "
"[资源夹具](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_resources/README.md)是实施时的比较入口，不能 把其旧结果标成新 API "
"的证据。实际 IRQ 延迟、栈峰值、FP/MVE 保留和低功耗时间 连续性仍需设备验证；本文不新增当前支持或 HIL 结论。"
msgstr ""
"The existing [Wait cost fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_wait_cost/README.md) and [resource "
"fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_resources/README.md) provide comparison entry "
"points for implementation. Their old results must not be relabeled as "
"evidence for new APIs. Actual IRQ latency, stack peaks, FP/MVE retention and"
" low-power time continuity still require device validation. This page adds "
"no current support or HIL conclusions."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:233
msgid ""
"[CMSIS-RTOS2 官方接口](https://arm-"
"software.github.io/CMSIS_6/latest/RTOS2/index.html) "
"说明共同线程/同步接口与调用者存储属性可以并存，值得借鉴术语与上下文规则。 但 CMSIS 接口存在不证明目标内核有合格实现，也不能替代 Nexus "
"的绝对 deadline、 外部 join、借用和关闭合同。本方案不引入 CMSIS-RTOS2 中间层，不改现有内核 pin。"
msgstr ""
"The [official CMSIS-RTOS2 interface](https://arm-"
"software.github.io/CMSIS_6/latest/RTOS2/index.html) shows that common "
"thread/synchronization interfaces can coexist with caller-provided storage "
"attributes. Its terminology and context rules are useful references. The "
"existence of a CMSIS interface does not prove a qualified implementation for"
" the target kernel, or replace Nexus absolute deadlines, external join, "
"borrowing and close contracts. This proposal adds no CMSIS-RTOS2 middleware "
"layer and changes no existing kernel pins."

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/os-portability.md:238
msgid ""
"实施采用不兼容迁移：公共合同冻结后同步迁移平台消费者、外部示例和测试，移除 旧后端公开入口，不保留 alias、兼容 wrapper 或 "
"fallback。后端内部可以复用真实 算法，vendor、gitlink、锁和许可记录保持原样。每次交付以真实生产 C 路径的 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock RED/GREEN、精确 ARM/Host 上下文、SDK 消费和成本差值为据。 "
"具体工作包、并行边界及退出条件由[实施计划](../development/os-portability-plan.md)维护。"
msgstr ""
"Implementation uses an incompatible migration: after freezing the public "
"contract, migrate platform consumers, external examples and tests together, "
"and remove the old backend public entry points. Retain no aliases, "
"compatibility wrappers or fallbacks. Backends may reuse actual algorithms "
"internally; vendor files, gitlinks, locks and license records remain "
"unchanged. Each delivery relies on GoogleTest/GoogleMock RED/GREEN of actual"
" production C paths, exact ARM/Host contexts, SDK consumption and measured "
"cost differences. The [implementation plan](../development/os-portability-"
"plan.md) maintains work packages, parallel boundaries and exit criteria."
